  "cli.help.full": "\n╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║  mip v{{version}} - SUPER FAST Package Manager                       ║\n║  ⚡ Parallel downloads + streaming extraction                ║\n╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\n📦 Core Commands:\n  mip init                              Create new project\n  mip install [pkg]                     Install packages\n  mip install -s [pkg]                  ⚡ SUPER FAST install\n  mip uninstall <pkg>                   Remove package\n  mip update                            Update all packages\n  mip list                              Show installed packages\n\n🔍 Info:\n  mip search <query>                    Search npm registry\n  mip info <pkg>                        Show package details\n  mip outdated                          Show outdated packages\n  mip why <pkg>                         Why is this installed?\n\n🔒 Security:\n  mip audit                             Check vulnerabilities\n  mip doctor                            System diagnostics\n\n🚀 Development:\n  mip create <template> <name>          Create from template (node, react, cli, express)\n  mip run <script>                      Run npm script\n  mip exec <cmd>                        Run local binary\n  mip link                              Link local packages\n\n📚 Monorepo:\n  mip workspaces list                   List workspaces\n  mip workspaces run <script>           Run script in all workspaces\n\n🧹 Maintenance:\n  mip cache clean                       Clear cache\n  mip cache size                        Show cache size\n  mip ci                                CI installation\n\n💡 Examples:\n  mip install -s express                ⚡ Super fast install\n  mip install lodash --save-dev\n  mip create react my-app\n  mip why lodash\n  mip cache clean\n  mip doctor\n\n⚡ Super Fast Mode Features:\n  • Parallel downloads (all packages at once)\n  • Streaming extraction (no temp files)\n  • Smart caching\n  • Lightning fast repeat installs\n  ",

